---
// Go modules, internal/ package visibility boundaries, and fast single-binary compilation pipeline.
const W = 900;
const H = 296;
---
<figure class="gf1a">
  <div class="gf1a-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Diagram of a Go module repository layout with cmd/api, internal/order encapsulation, exported Uppercase versus unexported lowercase symbols, and single static binary build.">
      {/* Left card: Module directory & Export visibility */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="440" height="268" rx="10" class="gf1a-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gf1a-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Module layout &amp; visibility boundaries</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Cấu trúc Module &amp; quyền truy cập Package</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="408" height="44" rx="6" class="gf1a-box" />
      <text x="44" y="79" class="gf1a-b">go.mod  (module github.com/acme/orders)</text>
      <text x="44" y="96" class="gf1a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Root dependency graph + Go version pin; zero node_modules.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chốt phiên bản Go &amp; thư viện; cả repo dùng 1 graph sạch.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="114" width="196" height="92" rx="6" class="gf1a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="135" class="gf1a-b-ok">cmd/api/main.go</text>
      <text x="44" y="153" class="gf1a-m">package main</text>
      <text x="44" y="171" class="gf1a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Imports order.NewService()</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Gọi được order.NewService()</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="189" class="gf1a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Blocked: order.taxRate</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bị chặn: order.taxRate</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="242" y="114" width="196" height="92" rx="6" class="gf1a-box is-red" />
      <text x="256" y="135" class="gf1a-b-red">internal/order/svc.go</text>
      <text x="256" y="153" class="gf1a-m">package order</text>
      <text x="256" y="171" class="gf1a-b-ok">Upper = Exported (Public)</text>
      <text x="256" y="189" class="gf1a-m">lower = package-private</text>

      <rect x="30" y="218" width="408" height="48" rx="6" class="gf1a-box" />
      <text x="44" y="238" class="gf1a-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Compiler-enforced internal/ rule + no circular imports:</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trình biên dịch khóa chặt internal/ &amp; cấm import vòng:</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="255" class="gf1a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Outside modules cannot import internal/*; cycles fail at build time.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Module ngoài không thể chạm internal/*; import A→B→A báo lỗi ngay.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right card: Toolchain commands & output */}
      <rect x="470" y="14" width="416" height="268" rx="10" class="gf1a-card" />
      <text x="486" y="42" class="gf1a-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Unified toolchain → Single static binary</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Bộ công cụ tích hợp → 1 file nhị phân duy nhất</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="60" width="384" height="44" rx="6" class="gf1a-box" />
      <text x="500" y="79" class="gf1a-b">gofmt -w .  &amp;&amp;  go vet ./...</text>
      <text x="500" y="96" class="gf1a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>One canonical code style; static bug checks built in.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chuẩn hóa format toàn đội ngũ; bắt lỗi printf/lock từ sớm.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="114" width="384" height="44" rx="6" class="gf1a-box" />
      <text x="500" y="133" class="gf1a-b">go test -race ./...</text>
      <text x="500" y="150" class="gf1a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Native test runner, race detector, coverage &amp; benchmarker.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tích hợp sẵn unit test, phát hiện race condition và benchmark.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="168" width="384" height="98" rx="6" class="gf1a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="500" y="189" class="gf1a-b-ok">GOOS=linux GOARCH=amd64 go build ./cmd/api</text>
      <text x="500" y="210" class="gf1a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Outputs 1 standalone binary (~10 MB) + runtime &amp; GC.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Xuất 1 file thực thi tĩnh duy nhất (chứa sẵn runtime + GC).</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="500" y="229" class="gf1a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Drop into scratch container — no JVM/Python runtime!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chạy thẳng trên Docker trống không cần cài runtime ngoài.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="500" y="250" class="gf1a-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Why fast? Reads export data directly — no header trees.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Build cực nhanh nhờ đọc tóm tắt export data thay parse lại.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Go treats formatting, testing, package visibility (Uppercase exported vs lowercase private), internal/ barriers, and cross-compiled static binaries as part of one cohesive toolchain.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Go gom format code, kiểm tra tĩnh, quyền truy cập theo chữ hoa/thường, rào chắn internal/ và biên dịch file tĩnh thành một quy trình thống nhất, không cần cài bộ tool rời rạc.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gf1a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gf1a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gf1a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gf1a text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gf1a-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gf1a-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gf1a-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gf1a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf1a-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf1a-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf1a-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gf1a-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1a-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf1a-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gf1a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
